Package: devjam-science-opensesame-psychopy
Version: 1.6-2
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-science-tools
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: OpenSesame Launcher with PsychoPy
 Desktop launchers for OpenSesame, PsychoPy, PsychoPy Studio and Sigmund
 Analyst in the PsychoPy environment in /opt/psychopy, including an
 OpenSesame launcher that runs as a user service with real-time
 priority, and manage-opensesame-affinity to set its CPU affinity.
